<title>UK: LSE changes fee structure for on-line service.</title>
<headline>LSE changes fee structure for on-line service.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Stock Exchange said it was changing its pricing structure for its on-line information services to give greater access to share information.</p>
<p>Effective April 1, 1997, share information will be free of end-user charges after 20 minutes.</p>
<p>The exchange said it would also introduce a &quot;per price request&quot; to simplify the charging mechanism for those requiring only occasional time share prices.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
